# Customer-local Terraform data and plans.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
private-tfplan.json
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars

# Locally pulled or rendered deployment artifacts.
charts/
rendered/
kubeconfig*

# Deployment credentials must be supplied through the customer's secret
# manager and must never be committed to this public repository.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
values/*-customer.yaml
